{"repositoryId":1411594802,"availability":"available","full":"zSamir015/obsidian-bank","name":"obsidian-bank","description":"Banking demo built like the real thing: React 19 + TypeScript, Supabase with Row Level Security, server-side money rules, a 3D card, PWA and web push. Bilingual, tested end to end.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":1,"created":"2026-10-09T09:23:33Z","updated":"2026-10-12T19:05:26Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://zsamir015.github.io/obsidian-bank/","topics":["accessibility","github-actions","i18n","lighthouse-ci","playwright","portfolio","postgresql","pwa","react","row-level-security","supabase","tailwindcss","tanstack-query","threejs","typescript","vite","vitest","web-push"],"demo":"https://zsamir015.github.io/obsidian-bank/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:12.525Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:12.525Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:12.525Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T23:48:12.525Z","stars":0,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React","Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A banking demo built like the real thing: Row Level Security, server-side money rules, a 3D card, offline-ready PWA and web push.","[]( []( [](#testing) [](#testing) [](LICENSE)","Obsidian Bank is a personal banking web app built as a portfolio project. It is not a real bank: no real money, accounts or cards are involved, and it never talks to a payment network."],"features":["Money rules live in the database. Balances only change through Postgres functions that check the caller, lock rows and run in one transaction. Row Level Security keeps every visitor inside their own data.","Fast on a mid-range phone. Lighthouse CI enforces an LCP, CLS, TBT and JavaScript budget on every pull request (Overview: about 2.2 s LCP in CI's simulated mobile profile).","A 3D card that never slows the first load. three.js lives in its own chunk, loads only on /cards with WebGL and full motion, and falls back to a static card.","Installable and bilingual. PWA with an offline screen (no account data is cached), optional web push for payments under review, and the whole interface in English and Spanish.","Tested end to end in both languages. Unit, database (PGlite), Playwright and axe tests; the journeys run 10 times in a row in CI without retries."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zSamir015/obsidian-bank/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6a744f00d9c2a4a8c733beb60a777e8778888fd90428d61be2110cfea966c9d7","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:12.662Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:12.662Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A banking demo built like the real thing: Row Level Security, server-side money rules, a 3D card, offline-ready PWA and web push.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zSamir015/obsidian-bank/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"PWA with an offline screen (no account data is cached), optional web push for payments under review, and the whole interface in English and Spanish.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zSamir015/obsidian-bank/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"\"Explore the demo\" calls Supabase's anonymous sign-in.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zSamir015/obsidian-bank/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6a744f00d9c2a4a8c733beb60a777e8778888fd90428d61be2110cfea966c9d7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zSamir015/obsidian-bank/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:12.663Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T19:05:26Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zSamir015/obsidian-bank/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:12.665Z","hash":"6a744f00d9c2a4a8c733beb60a777e8778888fd90428d61be2110cfea966c9d7","originalBytes":29769,"storedBytes":29769,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["supabase","card","only","run","every","cards","push","npm","one","app